{"unit_id":"wang-yi-bit64__dsh-parallel-worktree#feature-8","repo":"wang-yi-bit64/dsh-parallel-worktree","commit":"51ef3afb6de13722ab8911aa1b374de5e61edfa7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-parallel-worktree 的功能「状态查看」：工具和命令可列出 worktree 的路径、分支、是否存在、是否有未提交改动及相对基线的提交差距。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/manager.js:369-405","lib/tools.js:137-205"]}
