{"unit_id":"wang-yi-bit64__dsh-parallel-worktree#card-zh","repo":"wang-yi-bit64/dsh-parallel-worktree","commit":"51ef3afb6de13722ab8911aa1b374de5e61edfa7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-parallel-worktree 为 DSH 提供并行 Git worktree 管理。它注册 worktree_create、worktree_list、worktree_status 工具和 /worktree 命令，并在会话栏加入状态徽标与只读列表面板。用户可创建任务检出、查看分支和改动状态，并同步、合并或清理 worktree；创建时还可携带改动、环境文件或复用 node_modules。适合让多个 agent 在同一仓库并行开发的场景，需要 Node.js 20 以上及 Git。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26-42","lib/tools.js:65-74","lib/commands.js:427-434","lib/manager.js:303-350","client/client.js:27"]}
{"unit_id":"wang-yi-bit64__dsh-parallel-worktree#card-en","repo":"wang-yi-bit64/dsh-parallel-worktree","commit":"51ef3afb6de13722ab8911aa1b374de5e61edfa7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-parallel-worktree manages parallel Git worktrees in DSH. It adds creation and status tools, a /worktree command, and a read-only session panel. Developers can create isolated checkouts, inspect branch state, sync, merge, and clean up worktrees. Requires Node.js 20+ and Git.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26-42","lib/tools.js:65-74","lib/commands.js:427-434","lib/manager.js:303-350","client/client.js:27"]}
